+	"Finish signing in in the window that opened. Meiro closes it for you.":                                                         "请在弹出的窗口中完成登录，Meiro 会帮你关闭它。",
+	"Or use a browser you are already signed in with. This copy can stop working when that browser renews its cookies. Sign in at ": "或者使用一个你已经登录的浏览器。当该浏览器更新 Cookie 后，这份副本可能失效。请先在那里登录：",
+	" there first, then pick it:":                     "，然后再选择它：",
